Section 1.
Section three hundred and thirty-nine of Commonwealth Act Numbered Four hundred and sixty-six is hereby amended to read as follows:
"Section 339. Words and phrases defined.—The term "prohibited drugs" as herein used, includes opium, cocaine, alpha, and beta eucaine, and Indian hemp (marihuana), opium poppies, their derivatives, and all preparations made from them, including synthetic drugs which have habit forming properties such as the following:
