Section 52.
Representative District.
— Until otherwise provided by law, the City of Santiago shall continue to be part of the Fourth Congressional District of Isabela.
Section 53.
Applicability of Laws.
— The provision of Republic Act Numbered 7160, otherwise known as the Local Government Code of 1991, Presidential Decree Numbered Eight hundred and twenty-four, and other laws pertaining to the Province of Isabela and such laws as are applicable to cities shall govern the City of Santiago insofar as they are not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act.
Section 54.
Effectivity
. — This Act shall take effect upon its approval.
Approved, May 5, 1994.
