Eleventh Congress
[ REPUBLIC ACT NO. 8804, August 16, 2000 ]
AN ACT CONVERTING THE MUNICIPALITY OF BISLIG INTO A COMPONENT CITY TO BE KNOWN AS THE CITY OF BISLIG
Be it enacted by the Senate and House of Representatives of the Philippines in Congress assembled:
ARTICLE I
GENERAL PROVISIONS
Section 1.
Title.
- This Act shall be known as the "Charter of the City of Bislig."
Section 2.
The City of Bislig.
- The Municipality of Bislig shall be converted into a component city to be known as the City of Bislig, hereinafter referred to as the City, which shall comprise the present territory of the Municipality of Bislig, Surigao del Sur Province. The territorial jurisdiction of the City shall be within the present metes and bounds of the Municipality of Bislig, as follows:
Bounded on the East, along line 1 to 4 by the Municipality ofLingig;
Bounded on the South, along line 4 to 5 by the Municipality ofLingig;
Bounded on the West, along line 5 to 7 by the Municipality of Trento, Province of Agusan del Sur;
Bounded on the North, along line 7 to 8 by the Municipality of Tagbina and line 8 to 9 by the Municipality of Hinatuan;
